{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301980","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301980","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1830198001:1":{"text":"それでも、生前にブライト王立歌劇院で観たアデライン・ウォースには及ばないかな。まあ、セレネの歌唱力も大したものだけどね。","source_cn":"塞涅唱得是不错，但比起我生前在耀光皇家歌剧院听过的那位...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79DD4948F78C57A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830198002:1":{"text":"あの高音には、本当に魂を鷲掴みにされたよ――もちろん、精神的な意味でな。","source_cn":"那位的高音，才叫真正的穿透灵魂——当然，精神层面上的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47D335A1EC6873B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830198003:1":{"text":"またアデラインの話か……彼女が活躍してたのは、もう何世紀も前の話だろう。今の若い子がここまで歌えるのだから、素直に褒めたらどうなんだ？","source_cn":"你又拿艾德琳说事。她都是多少个世纪前的人物了，现在的孩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7320E89AFBBFA58D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830198004:1":{"text":"別に「及ばない」と言っただけで、駄目とは言ってないだろう。","source_cn":"所以我只是说“不如”，又没说她不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B2DDD77B2B32271","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830198005:1":{"text":"さあ、そろそろ行こう。席を取ってくれたお礼に、一杯奢らせてもらうよ。","source_cn":"走吧，请你喝酒，算是感谢你留的座。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x212C286AB7986809","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_i